 a brilliant hamster physicist with wild white fur and tiny round glasses, stands before a chalkboard covered in equations and diagrams. The camera slowly pushes in. Warm sunlight illuminates detailed fur, tweed fabric, chalk dust, aged books, and polished brass instruments. Photorealistic historical academia, rich textures, cinematic lighting. Audio: soft chalk writing, and absolute silence. As he looks at the camera, he says with a thinking voice: \"First, imagine a spherical chicken in a vacuum...\"","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Pixel-Spatial-Upscaler/resolve/main/examples/spatial_upscale_4x_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-08-02T08:37:51.000Z","likes":48,"downloads":1117,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6863ba6ff8d2d420b6c539a6","id":"Lightricks/LTX-Video-ICLoRA-pose-13b-0.9.7","cardData":{"tags":["ltx-video","image-to-video","text-to-video"],"pinned":true,"language":["en"],"license":"other","pipeline_tag":"text-to-video","library_name":"diffusers","base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-Video-0.9.7-dev"]},"lastModified":"2025-07-08T20:14:23.000Z","likes":24,"downloads":928,"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video"},{"_id":"6aa1760e6e77dd47c28225d6","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Deblur","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.5"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2.x-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","ic-lora","ltx-2.5","video-to-video","deblur","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"Reference shows a v