ghtricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/hands_seawater_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a herd of goats walking along a rocky dirt path. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER a shallow, clear stream flowing down the path and splashing around the goats' hooves. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/goats_river_sbs%203.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a hand reaching down over dry sand. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER calm, rippling water covering the ground, with the hand dipping in and water dripping from the fingers. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/hand_seawater_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows people and a cart in a narrow city alley. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER murky flood water filling the street, partially submerging the cart wheels and splashing against people's legs. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/alley_cart_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows dogs sniffing a dry forest floor covered in pine needles. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER calm, reflective flood water covering the ground, with the dogs standing in the shallow marsh. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/dog_marsh_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-10T17:48:47.000Z","likes":13,"downloads":652,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6aa28746398bc4c928d31505","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-LoRA-Cinemagraph","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.5"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2.x-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x","language":["en"],"tags":["cinemagraph","image-to-video","i2v","lora","ltx-2.5","motion-design","selective-motion","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"image-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"CINEMAGRAPH_MOTION, tripod locked-off static camera, zero camera movement, the man, face, hair, clothing, beach, sky, and background remain completely frozen, only the beach reflection inside his sunglasses moves, reflected time-lapse of ocean waves roll and shimmer in the lenses, everything outside the glasses stays still, seamless natural loop","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-LoRA-Cinemagraph/resolve/main/examples/Glasses_LTX_2.3_i2v_00272_.mp4"}},{"text":"CINEMAGRAPH_MOTION, tripod locked-off static camera, zero camera movement, the man and cow remain completely frozen, only the clouds in the sky move in fast time-lapse, clouds drift and roll across the sky, grass and foreground remain still, seamless natural loop.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-LoRA-Cinemagraph/resolve/main/examples/Jump_LTX_2.3_i2v_00347_.mp4"}},{"text":"CINEMAGRAPH_MOTION, tripod locked-off static camera, zero camera movement, the woman is frozen, her face, eyes, hair, clothing, seat, and airplane interior remain completely frozen, only the illustrated tear drops move downward along her cheeks like a cutout collage animation, seamless natural loop.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-LoRA-Cinemagraph/resolve/main/examples/Tears_LTX_2.3_i2v_00285_.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-10T17:37:48.000Z","likes":11,"downloads":639,"pipeline_tag":"image-to-video"},{"_id":"6aa26aea918888a0f2b3b2c1","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Decompression","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.5"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2.x-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","ic-lora","ltx-2.5","video-to-video","decompression","video-restoration","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"Reference shows a wide field of blooming sunflowers bordered by green trees, heavily compressed with visible macroblocking, chroma bleed, and ringing artifacts. Edited shows the same scene restored to high quality with sharp detail, clean edges, and no compression artifacts. ENHANCE QUALITY a wide field of blooming sunflowers bordered by green trees. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only compression artifacts and image quality differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Decompression/resolve/main/examples/Examples_2__27_sunflower_field_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows an aerial twilight view of a classical dome and illuminated city buildings, heavily compressed with visible macroblocking, chroma bleed, and ringing artifacts. Edited shows the same scene restored to high quality with sharp detail, clean edges, and no compression artifacts. ENHANCE QUALITY an aerial twilight view of a classical dome and illuminated city buildings. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only compression artifacts and image quality differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Decompression/resolve/main/examples/Examples_2__07_rome_dome_aerial_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows an aerial view of a vehicle driving on a desert dirt trail, heavily compressed with visible macroblocking, chroma bleed, and ringing artifacts. Edited shows the same scene restored to high quality with sharp detail, clean edges, and no compression artifacts. ENHANCE QUALITY an aerial view of a vehicle driving on a desert dirt trail. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only compression artifacts and image quality differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Decompression/resolve/main/examples/Examples_2__05_desert_trail_aerial_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-10T17:37:47.000Z","likes":7,"downloads":622,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6863ba4f250091ce512f0d99","id":"Lightricks/LTX-Video-ICLoRA-depth-13b-0.9.7","cardData":{"tags":["ltx-video","image-to-video","text-to-video"],"pinned":true,"language":["en"],"license":"other","pipeline_tag":"text-to-video","library_name":"diffusers","base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-Video-0.9.7-dev"]},"lastModified":"2025-07-08T11:03:18.000Z","likes":15,"downloads":615,"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video"},{"_id":"6863bae106d39ee