in still, seamless natural loop.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Cinemagraph/resolve/main/examples/Jump_LTX_2.3_i2v_00347_.mp4"}},{"text":"CINEMAGRAPH_MOTION, tripod locked-off static camera, zero camera movement, the woman is frozen, her face, eyes, hair, clothing, seat, and airplane interior remain completely frozen, only the illustrated tear drops move downward along her cheeks like a cutout collage animation, seamless natural loop.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Cinemagraph/resolve/main/examples/Tears_LTX_2.3_i2v_00285_.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-01T06:41:34.000Z","likes":48,"downloads":568,"pipeline_tag":"image-to-video"},{"_id":"6a9fc9d28c0e2c28c66dbf18","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Day-To-Night","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.5"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2.x-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","ic-lora","ltx-2.5","video-to-video","day-to-night","relighting","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"A realistic nighttime outdoor scene. A mountain landscape under a dark sky filled with bright stars and a prominent Milky Way. Deep natural shadows across the terrain with very faint ambient starlight. Photorealistic night. Only the lighting changes from day to night; identical composition, framing, camera movement and motion.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Day-To-Night/resolve/main/examples/Examples_6__step_003000_02.mp4"}},{"text":"A realistic nighttime scene. A cafe interior looking out at a dark city street at night. Warm overhead interior lights cast amber reflections on the furniture, contrasting with the cool ambient streetlights and deep shadows outside. Only the lighting changes from day to night; identical composition, framing, camera movement and motion.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Day-To-Night/resolve/main/examples/p_ind_35318605_night.mp4"}},{"text":"A realistic nighttime scene. A dimly lit interior at night with a warm, low-intensity artificial light coming from the right, casting deep shadows across the room and soft amber highlights on the subject reading. Low-key lighting, high contrast. Only the lighting changes from day to night; identical composition, framing, camera movement and motion.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Day-To-Night/resolve/main/examples/p_ind_6799040_night.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-10T17:37:45.000Z","likes":9,"downloads":519,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6aa270fbe92ed147b99abde1","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.5"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2.x-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","ic-lora","ltx-2.5","video-to-video","colorization","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"Reference shows a small wild rabbit sitting among rough textured boulders with a fallen log and dry grass behind it, rendered in high-contrast monochrome with soft natural daylight emphasizing the fine fur and the coarse stone surfaces. Edited shows the same scene with natural colors restored. COLORIZE a young brown cottontail rabbit with warm tan and grey-brown fur, a pale cream underside and soft pink inner ears, perched on weathered grey granite boulders flecked with green and ochre lichen. Behind it a bleached driftwood log and clumps of golden dry grass catch the warm late-afternoon sun, while muted green vegetation softens the blurred background. The light is gentle and warm, giving the rocks subtle earthy browns and the whole scene a calm woodland tone. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only color information differs between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization/resolve/main/examples/Examples_5__00_rabbit_rocks_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a butterfly resting on a blooming flower in grayscale, highlighting delicate wing patterns. Edited shows the same scene with natural colors restored. COLORIZE a vibrant butterfly with orange, brown, and white patterned wings on bright orange zinnia flowers against a soft, blurred green background. Warm sunlight illuminates the wings and petals. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only color information differs between reference and edited.  ","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization/resolve/main/examples/Examples_5__06_butterfly_flower_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a high-angle aerial view of a classical dome and city square at dusk in grayscale. Edited shows the same scene with natural colors restored. COLORIZE a cityscape with a weathered verdigris dome surrounded by warm orange and terracotta buildings. Warm streetlights illuminate the square below, contrasting with the cool blue twilight ambiance. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only color information differs between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization/resolve/main/examples/Examples_5__07_rome_dome_aerial_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-10T17:37:47.000Z","likes":7,"downloads":509,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6aa93c8bbd2efe5da2be21ad","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-LoRA-Slow-Motion-Control","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.5"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","lora","ltx-2.5","image-to-video","slow-motion","speed-control","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"image-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"A wide shot captures a busy urban street scene under bright daylight, featuring tall glass and stone buildings lining both sides, with a prominent vertical sign displaying \"RADIO CITY\" centered between structures; cars are completely stopped on a white crosswalk due to a visible red traffic light, and numerous pedestrians are actively crossing the street from left to right across the foreground; the camera remains static, presenting a front-facing viewpoint that encompasses the entire width of the roadway and sidewalk area, while the ambient soundscape includes the muted rumble of idling vehicles, the occasional distant city traffic noise, and the soft shuffling of many footsteps as people move across the asphalt; a medium shot frames several individuals walking purposefully across the crosswalk, their legs moving in synchronized steps toward the right edge of the frame, accompanied by a low, steady background musical score suggesting routine city activity, all rendered with crisp high-resolution detail and richly saturated film-grade color emphasizing the textures of the concrete, glass facades, and pedestrian clothing.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-LoRA-Slow-Motion-Control/resolve/main/examples/ny_street_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-15T14:59:15.000Z","likes":9,"downloads":476,"pipeline_tag":"image-to-video"},{"_id":"6a327da4c0a403dc35ef7e2a","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.3"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","ic-lora","ltx-2.3","video-to-video","colorization","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"Reference shows a small wild rabbit sitting among rough textured boulders with a fallen log and dry grass behind it, rendered in high-contrast monochrome with soft natural daylight emphasizing the fine fur and the coarse stone surfaces. Edited shows the same scene with natural colors restored. COLORIZE a young brown cottontail rabbit with warm tan and grey-brown fur, a pale cream underside and soft pink inner ears, perched on weathered grey granite boulders flecked with green and ochre lichen. Behind it a bleached driftwood log and clumps of golden dry grass catch the warm late-afternoon sun, while muted green vegetation softens the blurred background. The light is gentle and warm, giving the rocks subtle earthy browns and the whole scene a calm woodland tone. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only color information differs between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization/resolve/main/examples/Examples_5__00_rabbit_rocks_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a butterfly resting on a blooming flower in grayscale, highlighting delicate wing patterns. Edited shows the same scene with natural colors restored. COLORIZE a vibrant butterfly with orange, brown, and white patterned wings on bright orange zinnia flowers against a soft, blurred green background. Warm sunlight illuminates the wings and petals. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only color information differs between reference and edited.  ","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization/resolve/main/examples/Examples_5__06_butterfly_flower_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a high-angle aerial view of a classical dome and city square at dusk in grayscale. Edited shows the same scene with natural colors restored. COLORIZE a cityscape with a weathered verdigris dome surrounded by warm orange and terracotta buildings. Warm streetlights illuminate the square below, contrasting with the cool blue twilight ambiance. Subject identity, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only color information differs between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Colorization/resolve/main/examples/Examples_5__07_rome_dome_aerial_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-01T06:39:29.000Z","likes":22,"downloads":438,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6a6763d8f57fb74aa74bdd72","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Re