2b-IC-LoRA-Instant-Shave","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.3"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","ic-lora","ltx-2.3","video-to-video","beard-removal","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access"},"lastModified":"2026-09-01T06:39:11.000Z","likes":9,"downloads":381,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6a328b6726f06fbad37ef688","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.3"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE","language":["en"],"tags":["ltx-video","ic-lora","ltx-2.3","video-to-video","vfx","water-simulation","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"Reference shows a brown rabbit sitting on mossy rocks. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER a fast-flowing river with white foam rushing over and around the rocks behind the rabbit. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/rabbit_forest_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows hands drawing lines in dry sand. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER clear shallow water gently washing over the sand and filling the drawn lines. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/hands_seawater_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a herd of goats walking along a rocky dirt path. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER a shallow, clear stream flowing down the path and splashing around the goats' hooves. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/goats_river_sbs%203.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows a hand reaching down over dry sand. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER calm, rippling water covering the ground, with the hand dipping in and water dripping from the fingers. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/hand_seawater_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows people and a cart in a narrow city alley. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER murky flood water filling the street, partially submerging the cart wheels and splashing against people's legs. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/alley_cart_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Reference shows dogs sniffing a dry forest floor covered in pine needles. Edited shows the same scene with water added. ADD WATER calm, reflective flood water covering the ground, with the dogs standing in the shallow marsh. Subject identity, clothing, framing, and background geometry are identical to the reference; only water-related elements differ between reference and edited.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation/resolve/main/examples/dog_marsh_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-01T06:33:41.000Z","likes":34,"downloads":374,"pipeline_tag":"video-to-video"},{"_id":"6a579b5410f57d2a69ba7e3f","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Foley-V2A","cardData":{"base_model":["Lightricks/LTX-2.3"],"base_model_relation":"adapter","license":"other","license_name":"ltx-2-community-license","license_link":"https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE","language":["en"],"tags":["lora","ltx-2.3","foley","video-to-audio","text-to-audio","audio","diffusion-single-file","ltx"],"pipeline_tag":"text-to-audio","extra_gated_description":"By clicking \"Agree and Access\" you acknowledge the [Privacy Policy](https://static.lightricks.com/legal/Privacy%20Policy%20-%20LTX%20Platform.pdf) and consent to receive offers and updates including targeted and personalized advertisements. You can unsubscribe at any time.","extra_gated_button_content":"Agree and Access","widget":[{"text":"A heavy steel hammer repeatedly strikes glowing iron against a solid steel anvil, each blow landing as a hard metallic clang with a short resonant ring, brief spark spits, and faint forge-room ambience. No speech is present. No music is present.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Foley-V2A/resolve/main/examples/01_blacksmith_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Fingers type continuously on low-profile plastic laptop keys, producing rapid light clicks, muted key taps, and occasional soft contact on the aluminum palm rest in a quiet indoor room. No speech is present. No music is present.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Foley-V2A/resolve/main/examples/02_typing_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"A fighter delivers quick punches and forceful kicks into focus pads, producing tight padded smacks and deeper leather thuds in sequence, with fast foot pivots and soft scuffs on the gym floor. No speech is present. No music is present.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Foley-V2A/resolve/main/examples/03_focus_pads_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Shoes walk along weathered wooden boardwalk planks, producing firm hollow wooden footfalls, subtle plank creaks, and light sole scuffs, receding into a quiet forest. No speech is present. No music is present.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Foley-V2A/resolve/main/examples/04_boardwalk_footsteps_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Heavy boots step through thin snow and wet icy ground, producing soft snow compression, damp slush squelches, small ice-crust crunches, and muddy sole suction at close range. No speech is present. No music is present.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Foley-V2A/resolve/main/examples/05_wet_slush_sbs.mp4"}},{"text":"Motorcycles ride quickly along smooth mountain asphalt, their engines producing strong throaty revs and rising mechanical roars with tire hiss and steady wind rushing past. No speech is present. No music is present.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-LoRA-Foley-V2A/resolve/main/examples/06_motorcycles_sbs.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2026-09-01T06:41:49.000Z","likes":32,"downloads":371,"pipeline_tag":"text-to-audio"},{"_id":"6a3281a761ac1d8237745ef6","id":"Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Cross-Eyed",